{"id": "d5c09c91-8b3f-43ca-8baf-62ba386d1a3f", "name": "BATs-072 ISO 6469-1 過電流保護", "text": "RESS の活線導体の断面積に応じた過電流保護を設けること。当該過電流保護は短絡電流を開放できる能力\nを有すること。", "description": "", "stereotypes": [], "risk": "", "requirementId": "", "metaData": {"version": 1, "createdBy": "Atsushi-Nakata-ZA", "createdDate": "2026-09-24T18:27:33.959946", "ref": null, "createdOperator": "user", "modifiedBy": "Atsushi-Nakata-ZA", "modifiedDate": "2026-09-24T18:36:52.394376", "modifiedOperator": "user"}, "className": "Requirement"}
