{"id": "918b72e6-4d4e-4306-b1d3-13bede1fdabe", "name": "BATs-071 ISO 6469-1 活線導体の耐短絡電流性能", "text": "RESS の活線導体の断面積は、RESS の最大短絡電流に対する耐短絡電流定格 (I2t) を有すること。", "description": "", "stereotypes": [], "risk": "", "requirementId": "", "metaData": {"version": 1, "createdBy": "Atsushi-Nakata-ZA", "createdDate": "2026-09-24T18:27:33.959946", "ref": null, "createdOperator": "user", "modifiedBy": "Atsushi-Nakata-ZA", "modifiedDate": "2026-09-24T18:35:53.520891", "modifiedOperator": "user"}, "className": "Requirement"}
